      <p class="cs-mid-hook-text">If Meta is already an established acquisition channel, Google may capture demand differently, through branded searches and high-intent product queries, Shopping, and broader product discovery. The first question is not simply whether to launch Google. It is whether the account, product data, measurement, and available customer signals are ready for the launch.</p>
      <a href="../growth-diagnostic-landing.html#book" class="cs-mid-hook-link">See What the Growth Diagnostic Reviews &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

